## Task
Identify attack chains — sequences of findings that an attacker could combine to achieve a larger impact than any single finding alone.
Each chain must reference at least two finding IDs from the list above.

Respond with a JSON object whose "items" array holds attack chains:
{
  "chain_id": "chain_1",
  "name": "Short descriptive name",
  "description": "How these findings connect into an exploit chain",
